For my part, I curate the grammar-related resources on lojban.org,
this being the home page for that effort:

  http://www.lojban.org/tiki/Grammar

This part of the wiki is still a mess; I'd like to think I'm
improving it.  I'm in the middle of a particularly large project,
our so-called "Magic Words," and much of the work I've been doing
recently isn't user-visible yet.

Getting this section of the wiki in shape is really all I can make
time for, but it is also the section I care most about and really
want to see made better.

There are many sections on the website that could use curation, the
"See Also" section of the Grammar page 7 that need as much love as
the grammar-related resources.

If you see something that you can make better, please do so!

-Alan
